This distribution (version 0.6.0)
--------------------------------

Maintained by moqsting. It adapts the plugin to DeepSeek Harness 0.2.0-rc.2 and hardens the
security issues found in a review of the upstream source:

1. model-visible tool results escape the fence sentinels and every external source string is
   normalized at the pipeline boundary;
2. structured workbench Intents require a Host-issued, session-keyed grant instead of trusting
   message text;
3. the two monkey-patches of DSH core objects (the workspace `connectWorkspace` override and the
   `Session.beginSubmission` wrapper) are removed in favour of public surfaces and the plugin's own
   projection facts;
4. artifact media types are derived and allow-listed, receipts are bounded, spreadsheet text is
   normalized without a visible apostrophe, the download Blob URL is released one macrotask later,
   CI actions are pinned to commit SHAs, and the native smoke probe requires a per-run token.

